  "causebase_summary": "Democracy in Colour Limited (registered in Victoria) presents itself online as an organisation running a mix of campaigns, training and youth programs addressing racism and climate justice. Website excerpts list a Climate Justice Program, anti‑racism training (including workplace training), a Thriving in Colour youth program described as building the power, knowledge and skills of POC youth to lead community campaigns, and a Racism Out This campaign (which began with Racism Out Of Politics and Racism Out Of Media). The site also includes media statements (an “Anti‑Muslim response” is visible in the snapshot) and a statement of theory of change that says the organisation aims to build movements, advocate for policy reform and work in partnership with values‑aligned civil society organisations. Regulatory records referenced include an ACNC extract and an ACNC AIS for 2022–23, which shows reported revenue of AUD 901,276 and total expenses of AUD 728,081 for the period 01/07/2022–30/06/2023. The evidence is organisation‑authored website text and the ACNC filings; independent evaluation or detailed delivery locations beyond Victoria are not provided in the selected evidence.",
